{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 37, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the land of rising sun! A journey grand awaits thee in Japan a realm of ancient grace.\n\n**First Day: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Lights**\n\nUpon arrival at Narita's gate a sight most fair\nThy chariot doth await a swift and sure affair.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thou shalt ascend with glee\nAnd view the city's glow for all the world to see.\nDine upon ramen steaming hot and bold\nA tale of flavors centuries old.\n\n**Second Day: Tokyo's Cultural Embrace**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple journey forth with haste\nWhere Senso-ji stands a sacred space.\nExplore the Nakamise-dori stalls so bright\nWith trinkets treats and treasures a wondrous sight.\nThen wander through Ueno Park serene and deep\nWhere museums slumber secrets they do keep.\n\n**Third Day: Hakone's Volcanic Beauty**\n\nA pilgrimage to Hakone a mountain's keep\nWhere Fuji's peak doth silently sleep.\nCruise upon Lake Ashi a vista clear and wide\nWith mountains mirrored where the clouds do ride.\nVenture to Owakudani's hot springs' steam\nA sulfurous aroma a fantastical dream.\n\n**Fourth Day: Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy train thou'lt journey west a path defined\nTo Kyoto's gates a city of the mind.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermilion stream\nA thousand torii gates a vibrant gleam.\nKiyomizu-dera temple stands so tall\nA wooden stage overlooking one and all.\n\n**Fifth Day: Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden hue\nReflecting in the pond a vision new.\nGion's district wander where geishas glide\nA fleeting glimpse of beauty deep inside.\nNijo Castle's halls a history untold\nOf shoguns and power brave and bold.\n\n**Sixth Day: Nara's Deer and Temples Grand**\n\nTo Nara's lands thou'lt ride a joyful quest\nWhere friendly deer abound put hearts at rest.\nTodai-ji's Buddha a giant's might\nA sacred image bathed in golden light.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly gleam\n